<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Assessment Locked - Session Voided</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-light d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center min-vh-100" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-8 col-lg-6 text-center">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-5 bg-white">
                    <div class="stat-icon accent-danger mx-auto mb-4" style="width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%;">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill fs-2"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-dark">Assessment Session Ended</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-4 small">This exam session has been locked or voided because another browser tab was opened, the viewport lost active focus, or a duplicate login was detected.</p>
                    
                    <div class="alert alert-warning border-0 text-start mb-4" style="font-size:0.825rem;">
                        <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill me-2 text-warning"></i>
                        For security and integrity compliance, exam sessions cannot be recovered or resumed once closed. Please contact your system administrator or advisor to reset your submission.
                    </div>
                    
                    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm px-4"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-1"></i> Sign In Again</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>